{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 1300,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you eat just one carrot every day,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4500,
    "dDurationMs": 3700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that provides all the vitamin A you need to survive."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 10080,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But in some parts of the world, that's not easy to come by."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 13180,
    "dDurationMs": 6080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are an estimated 250 million preschool-aged children who are vitamin A deficient."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 19260,
    "dDurationMs": 3740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Most of them are in Africa and Southeast Asia, like here in India."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 23200,
    "dDurationMs": 5780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Of those, about 250,000 to 500,000 are severely vitamin A deficient."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 28980,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When that happens, they get night blindness,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 31650,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which means as the Sun goes down they lose their ability to see."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 35520,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now if you catch the condition at that point, and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 38560,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "give a child just a few high dose vitamin A supplements,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 42280,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "their sight can be restored within 24 to 48 hours."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 45360,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's like a miracle cure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 47649,
    "dDurationMs": 5191,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But if you don't, well the condition can continue to worsen until they're completely blind."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 52840,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And of those children who are completely blind,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 55580,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "roughly half die in the following 12 months."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 59920,
    "dDurationMs": 3889,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These are all things I learned while working on a new feature length"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 63960,
    "dDurationMs": 5500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "90-minute documentary called \"Vitamania\", all about these sense and nonsense of vitamins."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 69520,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I am not only the presenter of this documentary,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 71480,
    "dDurationMs": 3940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm also one of the co-executive producers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 75420,
    "dDurationMs": 2380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you can watch this documentary right now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 77800,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is live, on the web, for everywhere in the world"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 81700,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "except France and Germany because it's coming to your TVs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 84460,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But I will put a link to it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 85940,
    "dDurationMs": 1660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Vitamania the Movie\", in the description"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 87600,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and right here. And I want to show you a trailer"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 90580,
    "dDurationMs": 3220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for this film, so you get a sense of what it looks like, what it's all about."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 94160,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's something I've been working on for two and a half years,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 95729,
    "dDurationMs": 3371,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so I'm really proud of it, and I just want you  to go and check it out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 99100,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So here is the trailer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 105660,
    "dDurationMs": 7060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In 1913, Antarctic explorers Douglas Mawson and Xavier Mertz were fighting for their lives."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 113040,
    "dDurationMs": 4540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "With most of their food gone, they faced a stark choice:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 117580,
    "dDurationMs": 2140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Eat their dogs, or die."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 119720,
    "dDurationMs": 7840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[MUSIC]"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 127600,
    "dDurationMs": 2180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "After reluctantly eating their dogs,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 129780,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the men fell ill, burning with fever."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 134380,
    "dDurationMs": 2740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Within days, Mertz was dead."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 137540,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mawson, against the odds, made it back to camp."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 144580,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So what was the mystery illness that killed Mertz,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 148100,
    "dDurationMs": 2060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and nearly cost Mawson his life?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 150780,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, when they ate their dogs,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 152740,
    "dDurationMs": 2980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they weren't just eating canine flesh and fat."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 156160,
    "dDurationMs": 1820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They also ate the dog's livers,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 158400,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which contain high levels of vitamin A."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 161280,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So basically, they overdosed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 163840,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's a condition known as Hypervitaminosis A."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 169620,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hypervitaminosis A is rare but deadly,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 173500,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and today we know it can be caused by"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 176260,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "overuse of high-dose vitamin A supplements -"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 178820,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the same kind of supplements"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 180720,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that can save a child's sight."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 186980,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This power and complexity"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 190280,
    "dDurationMs": 3140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "lies at the heart of the great vitamin story."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 193420,
    "dDurationMs": 7760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[MUSIC]"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 201180,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm embarking on an epic world-spanning investigation"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 204840,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of vitamin science and history."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 207400,
    "dDurationMs": 860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"Aargh!\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 209480,
    "dDurationMs": 2540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"That is one big fish!\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 212020,
    "dDurationMs": 2528,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I want to know how we discovered them,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 214709,
    "dDurationMs": 1371,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "“You sure this is safe?”"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 216080,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what they actually are,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 218000,
    "dDurationMs": 2780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "“The 13 vitamins can be divided into two teams.”"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 221120,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "how we learnt to build them,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 224520,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "“Tonight, Walgreens and Target have pulled the products nationwide-”"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 227940,
    "dDurationMs": 1700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and how safe they are."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 229640,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "“All vitamins - all nutrients - they are toxic in high amounts.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 234040,
    "dDurationMs": 1520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "“We've got to start taking these seriously,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 235560,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as we should with every chemical we put into our bodies.”"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 238980,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm a scientist."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 240480,
    "dDurationMs": 3260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm also a father, and I want to know,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 243740,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "how do I do the best for my son."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 247820,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And one day, might he be taking vitamin pills to Mars?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 252600,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[ROCKET LAUNCHING]"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 256840,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Across the world, some experts claim that taking vitamins can be lifesavers,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 261120,
    "dDurationMs": 3700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "whereas others argue that it's just a waste of time or even dangerous."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 264920,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So how are we supposed to know whether to take them or not?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 269340,
    "dDurationMs": 5320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[MUSIC]"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 278780,
    "dDurationMs": 1940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I hope you enjoyed that trailer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 280720,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you want to check out the film you can click right here"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 282960,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or the link down in the description."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 285360,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I really hope you liked it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 286920,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let me know what you think in the comments below."
    } ]
  } ]
}
